        "description": "__Height:__ 160 cm\n__Cyberkinesis:__ Parasocial Pistol\n\nA member of Miden Academy's Level 1 Class B. A \"smotherer\", she spends her online time cyberstalking a bassist from a band she loves. Much like her love, her cyberkinesis manifests a gun that glues her to her target. She also loves eating sweet potato sticks and can't leave home without them.",
