          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b342422-YyYc3r3T7CVS.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 180 cm\n__Cyberkinesis:__ Banhammer of Civility\n\nA member of Miden Academy's Level 1 Class B, and Souji's roommate. A former gang member, he tends to use foul language but immediately course-corrects to act like a proper honors student. \n\nA \"thumper\", he has a daily routine of posting comments online to \"correct the evil that overflows on the internet.\" His cyberkinesis, in turn, manifests as a massive hammer that keeps the peace of internet discourse.",
