        "description": "__Height:__ 173 cm\n__Cyberkinesis:__  Onipien\n\nHe is one of the most well-known problematic streamers and is best known for his MyTuber username \"Aoringo.\" After the death of his sister, he is enrolled into Miden Academy to find the person responsible for her death. His cyberkenesis, owing to his past as a flamebaiter, calls forth eerie blue flames. Loves sweets, but often eats too much of them.",
