        "description": "__Height:__ 175 cm\n__Cyberkinesis:__ World Through a Shutter\n\nA member of Miden Academy's Level 1 Class B, and Kukuru's childhood friend. In spite of his kind expression, he can also be a venomous little devil at times. Loves snappingphotos on his phone, and his cyberkinesis allows him to create \"windows\" wherever he's taken one.",
