        "description": "__Height:__ 146 cm\n__Cyberkinesis:__ Hardcore Gamer-Powered Doll\n\nA member of Miden Academy's Level 1 Class B, an esports player and expert in hand-to-hand combat. She's withdrawn and loath to communicate in person, but her cyberkinesis allows her to control dolls that she can control using her video game skills. Typically uses Denmi-chan, Miden Academy's mascot, in battle.",
