        "description": "__Height:__ 183 cm\n__Cyberkinesis:__ Nirvana Wall\n\nA member of Miden Academy's Level 1 Class B. Contrary to his appearance, he doesn't like loud noises and is easily frightened. His cyberkinesis is more defense-oriented, creating walls of sound to protect himself and others when he listens to his MP3 player. Likes music, especially rock, and listens to them with his headphones gifted to him by his teacher.",
