        "description": "__Height:__ 188 cm\n\nTeacher of Miden Academy's Level 1 Class B. Once called the genius youth of exorcists, he now works to teach the next generation of them. Digitally inept, he can only fight dead accounts by converting his spiritual energy to digital using a special fan - while incredibly powerful, it's only a fraction of his power in its prime. Zero immunity to women.",
